## Features Summary

- **60+ Built-in + 7TV / BTTV / FFZ Animated Emotes:** Instant live rendering of top streamer emotes with zero latency.
- **BigEmote Auto-Scaling:** Messages with 1–3 emotes automatically scale to 1.8x size.
- **Card Background Opacity & Stroke:** Adjust from 100% solid HUD card to 0% pure floating text with high-contrast drop outline.
- **Hardware Glitch & 60fps Animations:** Smooth GPU-accelerated RGB displacement without CSS clipping corruption.
- **Procedural FM Synthesizer:** 6 custom synthesized sound profiles (`cyber`, `coin`, `chime`, `ping`, `pop`, `mute`).
- **Interactive Stream Test Deck:** Test incoming chats, subs, gift sub bombs, raids, and SuperChats with 1 click.
- **Zero Dependencies:** Pure HTML5 / CSS3 / ES2022.
